    {
      "lore": null,
      "name": "Blessings of the Omnissiah",
      "rules": "In your Movement phase, at the start or end of this unit’s move, you can select one friendly <k>Adeptus Astartes Vehicle</k> model within 3\" of this model: \\r<ul><li>That <k>Vehicle</k> model <b>heals</b> D3 wounds.</li>\\r<li>That <k>Vehicle</k> model’s attacks can ignore modifiers to <b>hit rolls</b> and <b>wound rolls</b> until the start of your next Movement phase.</li></ul>",
